<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova inflation falls to 1.4 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Moldova inflation falls to 1.4 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rise in Moldovan consumer prices slowed to 1.4 percent in February from 1.9 percent in January, the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES	Feb '97  Jan '97   Feb '96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		 +1.4     +1.9	+2.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	 +12.0    +13.0     +25.0</p>
<p>The National Bank expects annual inflation to drop this year to 10 percent from 15.1 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
